<title>Zola</title>
<h1>Zola</h1>
<p>Zola is a personal assistant that runs entirely on its owner's own computer.</p>
<h2>Privacy policy</h2>
<p>This application is for the owner's personal use only. It reads the owner's own mail and calendar
on the owner's own machine. No data is collected, stored elsewhere, shared, or sold.</p>
